ingest-exclusions.json
**/ingest-exclusions.json
ingest-single/
needoh-watcher/seen.json
needoh-watcher/watcher.log
*.tsv
*.vtt
*.srt
*.mp4
tiktok_transcripts/
tiktok/

# --- machine output only (added 2026-08-07, hygiene pass) ---
# Scope was deliberately limited to artifacts a build or run regenerates.
# Verified before adding: 0 tracked files match any pattern below, so nothing
# already in the repo is shadowed. The *.txt and *.json extensions are NOT
# ignored -- 6 and 8 tracked files use them respectively.
#
# NOT ignored on purpose, because they are real uncommitted work and the
# decision is already queued in CLAUDE.md Open Items ("second audit pass over
# non-.py files"): dex-chat/, AUDITS/, prompts/, AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG-v4.1.md,
# DEPLOYMENT-v4.1.md, and the _step*/audit_*/fetch_* scripts. Ignoring those
# would hide them rather than decide them.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.robots_cache/
.claude/
chromadb/
*.jsonl
*.log
